page('net','/results/','Research results',hero('Results / Runs','Fixed-budget confirmation<br>audited.','Seven conditional decisions from one complete, separately authorized second attempt.',False)+'<section class="section"><h2>RP002A · confirmatory-20261010-002 · COMPLETE</h2><p>60 independent units and 120 learned fits completed. All 484 hashes and saved-checkpoint/analysis replay passed. Two benefit, four equivalent and one indeterminate decision under the frozen .01-nat margins. No trace warning; optimal training is not established.</p><p>Result R-RP002A002 (VALID), Test TST-RP002A002. Conditional inference for three finite passive generators, without recurrence necessity, broad Claims or Cycle closure. First-attempt data remain separate.</p><a class="button" href="/sources/rp002a-confirmatory-002/">Read complete benchmark</a><p><a href="/sources/rp002a-confirmatory-002-protocol/">Second frozen protocol</a></p></section><section class="section"><h2>RP002A · confirmatory-20261009-001 · INCOMPLETE</h2><p>36/60 complete independent units and 73 saved fit traces. Stopped after a wall-time clock incident; preserved outputs replay without aggregate decisions or a VALID Result for that attempt.</p><a class="button" href="/sources/rp002a-confirmatory-001/">Read interruption and artifact review</a><p><a href="/sources/rp002a-confirmatory-protocol/">Frozen protocol</a> · <a href="/sources/rp002a-calibration-001/">Completed calibration</a> · <a href="/sources/rp002a-target-variance-001/">Completed variance assessment</a></p></section>'+'<section class="section"><h2>RP002A · pilot-20261008-001</h2><p>Three worlds, one replicate and at most three epochs. All 49 output hashes match; numerical outputs are finite. No hypothesis, equivalence or novelty decision was made.</p><a class="button" href="/sources/rp002a-pilot-001/">Read pilot review</a></section><section class="section"><h2>RP002A · convergence-20261008-001</h2><p>Twenty independent units, 40 model fits, about 83 seconds. Records and saved-checkpoint replay verified; convergence remains unresolved.</p><a class="button" href="/sources/rp002a-convergence-001/">Read convergence-stage review</a></section><section class="section"><h2>RP002A · convergence-20261009-002</h2><p>Forty fits completed in about 6 minutes 24 seconds. Artifact replay passed. Twelve near-cap warnings remain; optimization is still unresolved.</p><a class="button" href="/sources/rp002a-convergence-002/">Read longer-budget review</a></section><section class="section"><h2>RP002A · budget-transfer-20261009-001</h2><p>Six fits at intended data sizes completed in 5 minutes 48 seconds. All 50 outputs replay; no predeclared warning. One replicate per world supports no variance or inferential conclusion.</p><a class="button" href="/sources/rp002a-budget-transfer-001/">Read target-size feasibility review</a></section><div class="empty"><h2>Interpretation remains scoped.</h2><p>The first incomplete attempt remains visible beside the complete benchmark. No broad scientific Claim has been promoted. RP002A is CLOSED after an internal interpretation review. Cycle 01 remains ACTIVE; '+completion+'</p><a href="/sources/rp002a-package-review/">Read package review</a> · <a href="/sources/rp002a-package-decision/">Decision D-0004</a> · <a href="/research/">Explore planned work</a></div>')
